# ---------------------------------------------------------------- steps
putFrees is operation
putFrees purpose "Append the C that releases an operation's regions released at return, and leaves its recursion depth"
putFrees invariant none
putFrees typeParameter none
putFrees input buffer buffer.ByteBuffer borrowedMutable
putFrees input source String borrowed
putFrees input values subset.Values borrowed
putFrees input op subset.OpInfo copied
putFrees output none
putFrees outputOwnedBy none
putFrees raises syntax.Rejection
putFrees effect none
putFrees uses none
putFrees memoryHeap false
putFrees async false
putFrees maxRecursion none
putFrees label begin loopKind none
putFrees label begin within none
putFrees label eachValue loopKind forEach
putFrees label eachValue within none
putFrees label eachValue maxIterations valueCount
putFrees label eachValue over values
putFrees label readValue loopKind none
putFrees label readValue within eachValue
putFrees label readInfoDone loopKind none
putFrees label readInfoDone within eachValue
putFrees label free loopKind none
putFrees label free within eachValue
putFrees label depth loopKind none
putFrees label depth within none
putFrees label leave loopKind none
putFrees label leave within none
putFrees label done loopKind none
putFrees label done within none
putFrees label lost loopKind none
putFrees label lost within none
putFrees let seven Int64 7 immutable
putFrees let freeStart String "ss_region_free(v_" immutable
putFrees let freeEnd String "); " immutable
putFrees let leaveStart String "d_" immutable
putFrees let leaveEnd String " -= 1; " immutable
putFrees at begin do countValues
putFrees at begin goto eachValue
putFrees at eachValue branch ifNext values bind key String goto readValue else goto depth
putFrees at readValue do readInfo
putFrees at readValue branch ifError readInfo goto lost else goto readInfoDone
putFrees at readInfoDone do readOrigin
putFrees at readInfoDone do readReleased
putFrees at readInfoDone do regionCheck
putFrees at readInfoDone do bothCheck
putFrees at readInfoDone branch if frees goto free else goto eachValue
putFrees at free do readName
putFrees at free do doAppendString
putFrees at free do doPutWord
putFrees at free do doAppendString2
putFrees at free goto eachValue
putFrees at depth do readRecursive
putFrees at depth branch if recursive goto leave else goto done
putFrees at leave do readOpName
putFrees at leave do doAppendString3
putFrees at leave do doPutWord2
putFrees at leave do doAppendString4
putFrees at leave goto done
putFrees at done return ok none
putFrees at lost do readOpWord
putFrees at lost do makeLost
putFrees at lost return error lostError

